        <ExplanationTxt>A COPY OF THE FINAL FORM 990 IS PROVIDED TO ALL BOARD MEMBERS BEFORE FILING. EACH BOARD MEMBER REVIEWS THE 990 AND CONTACTS MANAGEMENT WITH ANY QUESTIONS OR CONCERNS. ANY CHANGES THAT ARISE FROM THE BOARD REVIEW ARE COMMUNICATED TO ALL BOARD MEMBERS BEFORE FILING THE RETURN.</ExplanationTxt>
